    "name": "GearUp API",
    "description": "Rent Sports & Outdoor Gear Instantly — full backend API collection.\n\nHow to use:\n1. Import this file into Postman (Import > File).\n2. Set the `baseUrl` collection variable (Variables tab) to your local server (http://localhost:5000) or your deployed Vercel URL.\n3. Run requests in this order: Register Admin/Provider/Customer -> Login -> Create Category (Admin) -> Add Gear (Provider) -> Create Rental Order (Customer) -> Create Payment -> Confirm Payment -> Update Order Status (Provider) -> Create Review (Customer).\n4. Tokens and IDs (customerToken, providerToken, adminToken, gearId, categoryId, rentalOrderId, transactionId, etc.) are captured automatically into collection variables by each request's Tests script, so you rarely need to copy/paste manually.",
